  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Prism · 棱镜 — DSH Glassmorphism Theme Plugin",
      "text": "A standalone distribution of `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-prism` for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) Web GUI. The plugin ships prebuilt (`lib/`) — installers never build anything."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Requires DeepSeek Harness `0.1.2-alpha.1` or later with the web profile (adapted for the 0.1.2 client layout: `dsh-client-store` + `dsh-client-ui-renderer` replace `dsh-client-runtime`). From the GitHub source:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:mantonlove/dsh-prism-plugin\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web`, refresh the page, then open 设置 → 插件 to find the 棱镜 master card; every knob lives in 设置 → 通用设置 → 外观 (collapsed groups — click a group title to expand).\n\nUninstall:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-client-ui-prism\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Frosted-glass material (clear / frosted / velvet), blur + global frost + six per-zone opacities (base / sidebar / cards / input / overlays / bubbles)\n- Full-range color controls (Codex-style): hex code input + click-to-pick swatch — theme color (drives accents + conversation landmarks), backdrop hue, per-mode text colors\n- Spring-damped sliders, font scale & family, animated aurora backdrop, per-scheme rotating photo/GIF wallpapers with fixed/loop playback and a manage mode\n- Master toggle restores the stock UI exactly; settings persist in localStorage and sync across tabs"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "Screenshots",
      "text": "**Effects** — the main surface under different glass treatments (workspace sidebar, hero screen, and composer):\n\n| Effect 1 | Effect 2 | Effect 3 |\n|---|---|---|\n|  |  |  |\n\n**Settings UI** — the appearance panel:\n\n| Materials, zones, fonts, and colors | Theme color, wallpaper rotation, and presets |\n|---|---|\n|  |  |"
    }
  ],
